      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I cannot provide medical advice, and because you have Stage 3 CKD, taking any potassium supplement—even a 99mg one—without explicit doctor approval is extremely dangerous and could lead to fatal heart issues. Your nighttime cramps and fatigue are common side effects of CKD management and should be evaluated by your nephrologist to determine the correct cause and treatment. Please contact your healthcare provider immediately before changing or adding any medication regimen.",
